as<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, o evento oferece os desafios da <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> e da <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> para atletas de estrada, bem como uma participativa <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> aberta a toda a fam\u00edlia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px